typos's list of misspellings, which is compiled into the typos binary,
includes entries taken in 2026 from the list of common misspellings that
Wikipedia contributors maintain at
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Lists_of_common_misspellings/For_machines
(commit 74e06603 "feat(dict): Extend from wikipedia's list" in
crate-ci/typos, 2026-01-07). typos took a selection of the entries and
merged them into its own list, in its own format. The authors of the list
are the contributors named in the history of that page. The typos
repository keeps a copy of the list in
crates/wikipedia-dict/assets/dictionary.txt.

